A props object containing a "key" prop is being spread into JSX:
  let props = {key: someKey, debt: ..., busy: ..., remove: ...};
  <DebtDeleteAction {...props} />
React keys must be passed directly to JSX without using spread:
  let props = {debt: ..., busy: ..., remove: ...};
  <DebtDeleteAction key={someKey} {...props} />
{"cases":4,"passed":4}
